Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:19:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] MiuiCamera: Add a stand-in for AudioParaManger

The camera drives the HyperOS audio zoom effects through this
framework class. Movie mode records through it unconditionally, so
without the class it never starts. Report audio zoom as unsupported,
the path HyperOS takes on devices without it.
